  "acceptance_5_registry_read_fits_bff_budget": {
    "bff_timeout_budget_seconds": 2.0,
    "root_cause_of_4_7_to_5_9s_latency": {
      "primary_cost_4_5_to_5_6s": {
        "location": "services/source_ingestion/runtime.py:_source_connector_entries -> _latest_source_record_by_connector -> self.evidence_repository.list_source_records()",
        "cause": "On hosted (SOURCE_INGEST_EVIDENCE_BACKEND=postgres), PostgresSourceEvidenceRepository.list_source_records() executed `SELECT payload FROM source_ingest.source_evidence WHERE record_type = 'source_record' ORDER BY append_id ASC` across the ~203 MB source_ingest.source_evidence table on EVERY GET /api/source-ingest/registry call, transferring ~100-140 MB of JSONB payloads over the socket and running json.loads + SourceRecord.from_dict() on ~15,000+ rows, even though _connector_freshness_summary_from_snapshot only reads latest_record for a single connector (tw-twse-tpex-official-market) and PostgresSourceEvidenceRepository already holds self._source_records in memory from startup reload()."
      },
      "secondary_cost_0_24s": {
        "location": "services/source_ingestion/runtime.py:_source_connector_entries -> self.store.read_freshness_snapshot() -> _connector_freshness_summary_from_snapshot",
        "cause": "On hosted 41 MB ingest_schedule.jsonl (~33,400 runs and ~33,400 receipts), every registry read sorted all 33,400 receipts three times, parsed 33,400 ISO timestamps via datetime.fromisoformat, and rebuilt static provider_examples and financial_data_source_catalog payloads."
      }
    },
    "fix_summary": [
      "Added _sync_and_list_source_records() in SourceIngestionRuntime that syncs PostgresSourceEvidenceRepository._source_records incrementally via `SELECT COALESCE(MAX(append_id), 0), COUNT(*) FROM source_ingest.source_evidence WHERE record_type = 'source_record'` and fetches only delta rows with `append_id > last_append_id` (0 payload rows transferred on steady reads).",
      "Scoped _latest_source_record_by_connector in _source_connector_entries and _connector_freshness_summary to connector_ids=('tw-twse-tpex-official-market',) (the only connector whose freshness evaluation reads latest_record) and cached the ranked record map when evidence state and latest completed run ID are unchanged.",
      "Added _grouped_freshness_snapshot() in SourceIngestionRuntime caching grouped runs, pre-ordered receipts, watermarks, and latest run per connector keyed by JsonlIngestScheduleStore journal state (_read_key, _read_offset, counts, and tail object identities).",
      "Cached static _provider_example_payloads() on SourceIngestionRuntime and unpatched financial_data_source_catalog_payload() in services/source_ingestion/routers/catalog_controller.py."
    ],
